---
description: Route interface design work to the design workflow.
alwaysApply: true
---
For UI creation, redesign, visual critique or interaction changes, use this plugin's design skill. Scale the workflow to the task: small edits preserve the existing system; new products establish direction before implementation. User instructions and existing product constraints take precedence. For work unrelated to UI, continue normally. Keep detailed guidance in the skills; do not load the full design library into every conversation. If the design skill is unavailable, report the missing component instead of pretending it ran.
